{"body":{"brand":"695f1b3e02972734a99b36ee","category":"69a82d006f785b990f7fb71b","colors":"black","description":"The Unihertz Jelly Star Max redefines what a smartphone can be — offering full Android functionality in an ultra-compact form factor that fits comfortably in your pocket, bag, or even palm. Designed for users who want maximum mobility without compromise, the Jelly Star 2 blends modern performance, reliable connectivity, and everyday convenience into the smallest flagship-level body yet.\r\nPerfect for minimalists, travelers, and anyone who prefers a smartphone that’s small in size but big on features.\r\n🔹 Key Features\r\n🌟 Ultra-Compact Display\r\nBrilliant 3.0″ IPS touchscreen — excellent clarity and responsiveness in a tiny footprint.\r\n📸 Dual Camera System\r\nRear Camera: High-resolution sensor for crisp everyday photos.\r\nFront Camera: Great for video calls and selfies — all with clean, reliable imaging.\r\n⚡ Smooth Performance\r\nEfficient multi-core processor handles social apps, messaging, videos, and daily multitasking effortlessly.\r\nAmple RAM and storage options keep everything running smoothly.\r\n📶 Full Connectivity\r\n4G LTE / VoLTE support\r\nWi-Fi and Bluetooth\r\nGPS navigation for maps and travel apps\r\nUSB-C port with OTG support\r\n🔋 All-Day Battery\r\nLong-lasting battery keeps you going through calls, messages, music, and navigation without frequent charging.\r\n🔐 Modern OS & Features\r\nRuns Android with access to Google Play (where supported)\r\nSecurity patches and app support for familiar smartphone experience\r\nCompact but connected.","productName":"Jelly star max","variants":[{"_id":"69aa2c294e08a9bcc1095490","color":"black","quantity":"15","regularPrice":"45000","salesPrice":"29000"}]},"fileCount":3,"level":"info","message":"Updating product","productId":"69aa2c294e08a9bcc109548e","timestamp":"2026-03-06 14:23:53"}
